                                "sense_id": "1c841d0f-34ce-3f36-bcfb-44231a597ce4",
                                "text": "Or probably all meals coalesced with him in an orgy of thick bread-and-marge and an array of sauce-bottles."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
